<https://posccaesar.org/ontology/quality-datum-aspect/0.1.0/ont/core-owl> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "QualityDatum Value Aspect Extension Ontology OWL"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://posccaesar.org/ontology/quality-datum-aspect/0.1.0/ont/core-owl> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <http://rds.posccaesar.org/ontology/plm/ont/core> .
<https://posccaesar.org/ontology/quality-datum-aspect/0.1.0/ont/core-owl> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/meta/AnnotationVocabulary/> .
